WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.669
-Guys, it's time for
"Tonight show Hashtags."

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:03.736
Here we go.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:04.870
♪♪

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.239
-♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:09.208
♪♪

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:10.410
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:13.479
♪♪

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:15.314
-Hey, we do this thing
every week

00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:17.416
where I send out a hashtag
and ask you guys

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:18.952
to respond to that topic.

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:20.787 line:0%
This week I thought it would be
fun to try

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:23.123 line:0%
"Add a Word, Ruin a TV Show."

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:25.424 line:0%
For example, I sent out
a tweet that said,

00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:27.193
"The Last Chicken Dance."

00:00:29.862 --> 00:00:32.365
That's my go-to, man.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:34.266
They don't do that
at weddings anymore.

00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:35.802
-Oh, the chicken dance.
-Yeah.

00:00:35.802 --> 00:00:37.704
-Yeah, sure, they do.
-No.

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:41.708
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:42.875
-Nah.
-I don't get invited

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:44.577
to weddings anymore,
so maybe they do.

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:46.312
Do you think they do?
-I know they do.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.813
-No.

00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:49.982
No, they do the other one,
like...

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:51.384
move to the left --

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.686
-Oh, yeah,
the cha cha slide?

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.755
-Yeah, they do that
instead of the chicken dance.

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.423
-No, they do it in addition.

00:00:57.423 --> 00:01:00.427
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:04.731
-You know what?
[ Speaks indistinctly ]

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:08.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.436
Freeze it.

00:01:10.436 --> 00:01:12.438
Within minutes, it became
a trending topic in the U.S.,

00:01:12.438 --> 00:01:13.940
so thank you
for playing along.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:17.643
We love playing this with the
Twitter and all that stuff.

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:19.212
So thank you, guys,
so much for doing this.

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.479
It's fun.
We do it every week.

00:01:20.479 --> 00:01:21.914
So now I thought I'd share
some of my favorite

00:01:21.914 --> 00:01:25.184
"Add a Word, Ruin a TV Show"
responses from you guys.

00:01:25.184 --> 00:01:28.187
