00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:45.732
-[ Chuckles ]

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:47.967
-Outlander.

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:51.537
This one is from @LaichItIs.

00:02:51.537 --> 00:02:54.173
